  "notes": "Record 43 of a stellar-core --check-lcm golden file, copied byte for byte. Relation to wallet-backend#731 is 'covers', not 'reproduces': the header's StellarValue uses the protocol-30 SIGNED_MS arm (CAP-0088). Measured on 2026-11-17: wallet-backend at both the pre-fix commit 764a4f5bcbff and the fix c152783c054c (go-stellar-sdk v0.7.3) fails to decode it (\"'3' is not a valid StellarValueType enum value\") and does not advance. The reproduction of #731 uses the sibling entry cap0073-sac-trust-creates-trustline-signed-header, the same ledger from the previous recording of the golden."
